Turn the prototype into a convenient Mac utility.

Potential features:

* menu-bar application;
* source selection;
* recording/retention indicator;
* language/profile selection;
* configurable hotkeys;
* model selection;
* rolling transcript window;
* answer window;
* silent screenshot capture;
* safe behavior while the Mac is screen-sharing.

Be especially careful that an LLM interpretation window does not unexpectedly appear in material I am sharing with meeting participants.

